= Solution
{parent=e}

The form $iF_\nabla$ is the <Ricci form of a Kähler manifold>. In complex dimension one, $iF_\nabla=K_g\omega_X=\frac12\operatorname{Scal}_g\omega_X$. Thus
$$
\lambda=K_g=\frac12\operatorname{Scal}_g,
$$
where $K_g$ is the Gaussian curvature.

