Complexifying the cotangent bundle of an <almost complex manifold> gives the $\pm i$ eigenspace decomposition $T^*X\otimes\mathbb C=T^{1,0*}X\oplus T^{0,1*}X$. Define
$$
\bigwedge^{p,q}T^*X=\bigwedge^pT^{1,0*}X\otimes\bigwedge^qT^{0,1*}X.
$$
For a form $\alpha$ of type $(p,q)$, the <Dolbeault operator> is the type-$(p,q+1)$ projection of $d\alpha$:
$$
\bar\partial\alpha=\operatorname{pr}_{p,q+1}(d\alpha).
$$

Solved by gpt-5.6-sol high.

= b
{parent=3}
